==Overview==
'''Elixirs''' provide a passive bonus while active.

Elixirs are only available to {{ClassTooltip|class_name=Alchemist}} and {{ClassTooltip|class_name=Desolator}}.

The type of elixir activated is a result of selecting the required "ingredients" from the "recipe" for the desired elixir. An "ingredient" may be added by casting a specific type of Spell, or by pressing the relevant hotkey or clicking the button that corresponds to the type of Spell.

