==Types==
===Evocation===
{{ElixirTooltip|Elixir_name=Evocation}} elixir increases Evocation efficiency when active for:
* [[Alchemist#Hero Abilities|Alchemist]]
* [[Desolator#Hero Ability|Desolator]]

===Pet===
{{ElixirTooltip|Elixir_name=Pet}} elixir increases Pet Ability Power when active for:
* [[Alchemist#Hero Abilities|Alchemist]]
* [[Desolator#Hero Ability|Desolator]]

===Summoning===
{{ElixirTooltip|Elixir_name=Summoning}} elixir increases Summoning efficiency when active for:
* [[Alchemist#Hero Abilities|Alchemist]]
* [[Desolator#Hero Ability|Desolator]]

===Shadow===
{{ElixirTooltip|Elixir_name=Shadow}} elixir increases [[Liquid Shadow]] Power when active for:
* [[Desolator#Hero Ability|Desolator]]

